OL,3,GNEWSAOff-duty nurse saves man 'minutes
OL,4,Afrom death' in cardiac arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said she had dealt with cardiac
OL,7,Farrests at work frequently but it was
OL,8,F"a little bit daunting" to do it
OL,9,Fwithout the support of colleagues.
